WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:02.763
- Did you say, did you
say that back to them?

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:05.503
(Jen laughs)

00:00:05.503 --> 00:00:06.873
- You're talking in your sleep again.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:10.588
(bouncy music)

00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:11.981
- [Jen] Well, I am Jen.

00:00:11.981 --> 00:00:14.535
I've been dating Steve
for about three years now.

00:00:14.535 --> 00:00:16.973
I think he might be a little annoyed.

00:00:16.973 --> 00:00:19.179
I've been recording you
and, like, putting them

00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:21.593
up onto my Snapchat story.

00:00:21.593 --> 00:00:23.219
- This is like blowing
my mind a little bit.

00:00:23.219 --> 00:00:24.971
How long have you been doing this for?

00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:27.050
(Jen laughs)

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.511
- Just like, six months.

00:00:29.511 --> 00:00:31.160
- Six mo - six months?

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.344
Are you kidding me?

00:00:36.049 --> 00:00:37.475
- There are so many funny things

00:00:37.475 --> 00:00:38.845
that he says in his sleep.

00:00:38.845 --> 00:00:40.656
Every day is a surprise.

00:00:40.656 --> 00:00:42.421
- What time do you wanna go tomorrow?

00:00:42.421 --> 00:00:45.207
- [Steve] She, uh, knows
that I don't use Snapchat.

00:00:45.207 --> 00:00:47.947
I have one, but I don't really use it.

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.478
And she, basically it's the perfect crime.

00:00:50.478 --> 00:00:53.334
- [Jen] I can't even comprehend

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:56.352
how some of the things he
says gets into his head.

00:00:56.352 --> 00:00:59.301
- If it wasn't me, I'd
be laughing at it, so.

00:00:59.301 --> 00:01:01.925
(violin music)

00:01:01.925 --> 00:01:03.736
- Well, you wanna, you wanna watch some?

00:01:03.736 --> 00:01:04.456
- Not really.

00:01:04.456 --> 00:01:07.567
Are we supposed to go get the shot off?

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.819
It doesn't even sound like my voice.

00:01:09.819 --> 00:01:11.863
What time do you wanna go tomorrow?

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.116
- I was trying not to share.

00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:14.279
- When I say, "What time
do you wanna go tomorrow,"

00:01:14.279 --> 00:01:14.790
- Yeah, what time do you want to go ...

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.299
- I'm always making plans
(Jen laughs)

00:01:16.299 --> 00:01:17.760
in my dreams, apparently.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:20.148
Apparently that's all I'm
doing, is making plans.

00:01:20.148 --> 00:01:22.683
Oh no no no no no.

00:01:22.683 --> 00:01:24.342
What time do we wanna go get the ...

00:01:24.342 --> 00:01:25.967
(Jen laughs)
Same thing!

00:01:25.967 --> 00:01:27.535
- Clean up.

00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:32.266
- At least I look, like,
angry and confused there,

00:01:32.266 --> 00:01:32.924
(Jen laughs)

00:01:32.924 --> 00:01:34.176
like, what is this light

00:01:34.176 --> 00:01:36.103
that is stopping me from making plans?

00:01:36.103 --> 00:01:37.096
Apparently.

00:01:39.189 --> 00:01:40.440
- [Steve] It's trippy.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.046
That's the best word I
can use to describe it.

00:01:43.046 --> 00:01:43.858
Trippy.

00:01:43.858 --> 00:01:44.578
- Yeah.

00:01:44.578 --> 00:01:46.064
- I'm concerned it's a crime. Right?

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:48.141
This is like a very,
- A low-level.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:50.360
- modest, casual,
low-level crime, it's like

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.612
right below jaywalking, right?

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.132
- (laughs) Yeah.

00:01:53.132 --> 00:01:54.678
- Right? So I gotta figure out something

00:01:54.678 --> 00:01:57.279
that's equal and fair
in terms of retaliation.

00:01:57.279 --> 00:01:59.044
- You still love me, right?

00:01:59.044 --> 00:02:02.503
- I guess.

00:02:02.503 --> 00:02:04.802
You gotta find the right
port so that it'll work.

00:02:04.802 --> 00:02:06.776
(mumbling)

00:02:06.776 --> 00:02:10.003
We should go to the store
so that we can pick up

00:02:10.003 --> 00:02:12.209
